<title>FINLAND: RAUTE REPEATS SEES 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>RAUTE REPEATS SEES 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mechanical wood industry machinery maker Raute Oy repeated on Tuesday its forecast of a full-year 1996 loss.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite expected positive results for Raute Wood and Raute Precision business group, and measures to improve Durand-Raute's profitability, the Raute group will not yet reach a profit in 1996,&quot; Raute said in a statement with its January-August results.</p>
<p>In 1995, Raute had a 1.1 million markka full-year profit after financial items.</p>
</text>
